#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
nidin - agent-native CLI for the 你訂 (Nidin) group-ordering platform.

Zero dependencies (Python 3.8+ stdlib only). Every command supports --json for
machine consumption. Designed to be driven by a human OR by an agent runtime.

The upstream API is undocumented and reverse-engineered from the web bundle.
Response shapes are best-effort: when a field is missing the command degrades to
returning the raw payload rather than crashing. Use `nidin raw` for anything
this CLI does not model yet.
"""
